      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I guess if the URL doesn't have a protocol specified this could be fine. Like \"butts\" is okay to search, but don't search if given \"butts://butts\", or more specifically rtsp, rtspt...\n\nDoes the current system support url without https://?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
